{"id":"gleichzeitig","lemma":"gleichzeitig","pos":"adv","rank":1692,"glosses":["at the same time, simultaneously"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/4/49/De-gleichzeitig.ogg/De-gleichzeitig.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Wir kamen gleichzeitig dort an.","en":"We got there at the same time.","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"to come","l":"kommen"},null,{"g":"there, yonder"},{"g":"at / on"}]},{"text":"Sie kann beides gleichzeitig.","en":"She can do both at the same time.","words":[{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"können"},{"g":"both","l":"beide"},null]},{"text":"Du kannst nicht beides gleichzeitig tun.","en":"You can't do both at the same time.","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"können"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"both","l":"beide"},null,{"g":"to do"}]},{"text":"Es passierte alles gleichzeitig.","en":"It happened all at once.","words":[{"g":"it"},{"g":"to happen","l":"passieren"},{"g":"everything"},null]},{"text":"Wir sind gleichzeitig angekommen.","en":"We arrived at the same time.","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"are","l":"sein"},null,{"g":"to arrive","l":"ankommen"}]}]}